# PULSE: black key 6 hits the kick, 7 the tick. Playing, the generator plays it as the scene asks:
# ECLIPSE's first scene has none; PERIGEE's pulses (more with DENSITY up), over its drones, no clicks,
# no clips. STOP: it stops
autoplay 0
wait 300
wav pulse.wav
tapkey b5
wait 600
expect kicks 1
tapkey b6
wait 600
expect kicks 1
expect peak_db_min -30
tap PLAY
wait 8000
expect kicks 1
tap PLAY
wait 3000
tap LFO
turn SELECT 4
tap SEL
expect journey 5
tap HOME
turn K2 32
expect macro2 127
tap PLAY
wait 16000
expect kicks >5
shot pulse.png
tap PLAY
wait 3000
expect kicks <40
wavstop
expect clips 0
